Spawn is the Eldritch Gifts Atavistic Tradition. A Spawn does not improve toward a known species or completed target template; it uncovers an alien body plan hidden inside the Eldritch Core, one organ and contradiction at a time. Each retained structure is evidence that the character's original Species was only one provisional arrangement of the body. Super-facing Gifts manifest as temporary anatomy through Eldritch Core Power Stunts; successful manifestations can become permanent body modifications, and those permanent modifications can reveal one further retainable layer of anatomy.

